  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a poblaciones vulnerables afectadas por el coronavirus en Bolivia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Vulnerable Populations Affected by Coronavirus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de desarrollo general de este proyecto es contribuir a asegurar niveles mnimos de calidad de vida de las personas vulnerables frente a la crisis causada por el COVID-19. El objetivo espcfico es apoyar niveles mnimos de ingreso de personas afectadas por el coronavirus, en el periodo inmediato y durante la recuperacin .</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of this project is to help ensure minimum levels of quality of life for vulnerable people in the face of the crisis caused by COVID-19 in Bolivia. The specific objective is to support minimum income levels of people affected by the coronavirus, in the immediate period and during recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
